SliceBench — Master Attribution Index
=====================================

This file is a single-page index of every dataset bundled with SliceBench,
its license, and where to find the canonical attribution. SliceBench's
source code (Python modules under this directory) is MIT-licensed; image
content and per-section ground-truth coordinates are licensed per dataset
as listed below.

Each entry below points at a dataset's LICENSE and NOTICE files. Treat
those per-folder files as authoritative — this index is a convenience.

For a full prose summary with verification provenance and commercial-use
implications, see ./LICENSES_CORONAL.md.

